WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.042 --> 00:00:01.793
♪♪

00:00:01.793 --> 00:00:03.211
BUCKY BARNES
Steve believed in you.

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:06.214
He trusted you.

00:00:07.882 --> 00:00:09.217
Why'd you give
up that shield?

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:13.471
SAM WILSON
I did what I thought was right.

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:15.181
♪♪

00:00:15.223 --> 00:00:17.100
SAM WILSON
The legacy of that shield is...

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:20.228
...complicated.

00:00:22.313 --> 00:00:23.773
JOHN WALKER
I am Captain America.

00:00:24.774 --> 00:00:26.276
♪♪

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:31.072
BUCKY BARNES
I know what we have to do.

00:00:32.741 --> 00:00:34.242
JOHN WALKER
A word of advice then...

00:00:34.951 --> 00:00:36.369
...stay the hell out
of my way.

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:39.873
SAM WILSON
He bled for this country.

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:45.628
SAM WILSON
Shield or no shield...

00:00:47.797 --> 00:00:49.049
...I'm not going to let
anybody tell me

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:50.300
I can't fight
for it.

00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:01.519
SAM WILSON
We don't want anyone else to get hurt.

00:01:01.519 --> 00:01:03.730
♪♪

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:07.901
JOHN WALKER
You don't want to do this.

00:01:11.529 --> 00:01:12.781
BUCKY BARNES
Yeah, we do.

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:18.912
♪♪

